# Exiling a spell is not countering it (CR 724.1b, 701.6): Bot2's Abrupt Decay, which can't be countered, is aimed at
# Bot1's Sol Ring, and Bot1's Time Stop exiles it from the stack all the same. Sol Ring survives, and Abrupt Decay is in
# exile, not the graveyard.

